WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.840
Five tips for a successful Invisalign
journey.

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:05.920
Tip number one, wear your aligners
consistently.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:08.040
Aim for 22 hours a day.

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.640
Invisalign only works when you wear them.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:14.140
Tip number two, remove your aligners when
eating or drinking.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.680
Except water. This will help protect both
your teeth and the aligners.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.580
Tip number three, keep everything clean.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:25.500
That means brushing and flossing regularly
and cleaning your liners

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.760
daily. Tip number four, stay on schedule
with changes and appointments.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.580
Follow our instructions and don't skip check
-ins.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:38.040
Tip number five, listen to your teeth, mild
pressure is normal, but report

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:41.300
significant pain, poor fit, or anything
unusual.

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:44.300
Remember, Invisalign is a team effort.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:47.320
Your daily habits are the key to your
success.